      "writtenOn": "2016-05-07T02:00:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Okay, thank you for the details Shawn.\nI will add pd_snk_is_vbus_provided(port) for both attach \u0026 detach so that we don\u0027t overwrite the events which are not processed serially. And also update the charge manger for VBUS even for BC1.2 detach event.",
      "parentUuid": "d22e3090_b155180e",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 172,
        "startChar": 8,
